_fei","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan","book_id":"b-jinshu-052","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-052-hua-tan-ws2604575"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001","text":"祐字永猷。永安中，從惠帝北征。帝遷長安，祐反國。及帝還洛，以征南兵八百人給之，特置四部牙門。永興初，率眾依東海王越，討劉喬有功，拜揚武將軍，以江夏雲杜益封，並前二萬五千戶。越征汲桑，表留祐領兵三千守許昌，加鼓吹、麾旗。越還，祐歸國。永嘉末，以寇賊充斥，遂南渡江，元帝命為軍諮祭酒。建武初，為鎮軍將軍。太興末，領左軍將軍，太甯中，進號衛將軍，加散騎常侍。咸和元年，薨，贈侍中、特進。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":35,"last_line":35,"raw_start":2607,"raw_end":2806,"raw_character_offsets":[2609,2610,2611,2612,2613,2614,2615,2616,2617,2618,2619,2620,2621,2622,2623,2624,2625,2626,2627,2628,2629,2630,2631,2632,2633,2634,2635,2636,2637,2638,2639,2640,2641,2642,2643,2644,2645,2646,2647,2648,2649,2650,2651,2652,2653,2654,2655,2656,2657,2658,2659,2660,2661,2662,2663,2664,2665,2666,2667,2668,2669,2670,2671,2672,2673,2674,2675,2676,2677,2678,2679,2680,2681,2682,2683,2684,2685,2686,2687,2688,2689,2690,2691,2692,2693,2694,2695,2696,2697,2698,2699,2700,2701,2702,2703,2704,2705,2706,2707,2708,2709,2710,2711,2712,2713,2714,2715,2716,2717,2718,2719,2720,2721,2722,2723,2724,2725,2726,2727,2728,2729,2730,2731,2732,2733,2734,2735,2736,2737,2738,2739,2740,2741,2742,2743,2744,2745,2746,2747,2748,2749,2750,2751,2752,2753,2754,2755,2756,2757,2758,2759,2760,2761,2762,2763,2764,2765,2766,2767,2768,2769,2770,2771,2772,2773,2774,2775,2776,2777,2778,2779,2780,2781,2782,2783,2784,2790,2791,2792,2793,2796,2797,2798,2799,2800,2801,2802,2803,2804,2805],"revision_id":2650517},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0000","surface":"祐","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"2pi_e3t_aia","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0002","surface":"永猷","start":2,"end":4,"person_id":"2pi_e3t_aia","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0010","surface":"惠帝","start":10,"end":12,"person_id":"7e0_f69_1ac","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0020","surface":"祐","start":20,"end":21,"person_id":"2pi_e3t_aia","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0053","surface":"東海王越","start":53,"end":57,"person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0059","surface":"劉喬","start":59,"end":61,"person_id":"7xd_7vq_fwl","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0086","surface":"越","start":86,"end":87,"person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0088","surface":"汲桑","start":88,"end":90,"person_id":"i8p_oo3_u9t","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0093","surface":"祐","start":93,"end":94,"person_id":"2pi_e3t_aia","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0109","surface":"越","start":109,"end":110,"person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0112","surface":"祐","start":112,"end":113,"person_id":"2pi_e3t_aia","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0131","surface":"元帝","start":131,"end":133,"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-ju-son-you-ws2650517"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p008","text":"穎既廢，河北思之。鄴中故將公師籓、汲桑等起兵以迎穎，眾情翕然。顒復拜穎鎮軍大將軍、都督河北諸軍事，給兵千人，鎮鄴。穎至洛，而東海王越率眾迎大駕，所在鋒起。穎以北方盛強，懼不可進，自洛陽奔關中。值大駕還洛，穎自華陰趨武關，出新野。帝詔鎮南將軍劉弘、南中郎將劉陶收捕穎，於是棄母妻，單車與二子廬江王普、中都王廓渡河赴朝歌，收合故將士數百人，欲就公師籓。頓丘太守馮嵩執穎及普、廓送鄴，范陽王虓幽之，而無他意。屬虓暴薨，虓長史劉輿見穎為鄴都所服，慮為後患，秘不發喪，偽令人為臺使，稱詔夜賜穎死。穎謂守者田徽曰：「范陽王亡乎？」徽曰：「不知。」穎曰：「卿年幾？」徽曰：「五十。」穎曰：「知天命不？」徽曰：「不知。」穎曰：「我死之後，天下安乎不安乎？我自放逐，於今三年，身體手足不見洗沐，取數斗湯來！」其二子號泣，穎敕人將去。乃散發東首臥，命徽縊之，時年二十八。二子亦死。鄴中哀之。","te